1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,200
Again, again, again.

2
00:00:01,233 --> 00:00:02,200
I'll teach you a wacky pose.

3
00:00:02,633 --> 00:00:05,333
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

4
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:07,467
You do it like this. Bleh.

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,400
[SQUEALS]

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:17,700
[HUFFING, CRYING]

7
00:00:19,267 --> 00:00:22,700
Not like that
You look like an old guy.

8
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,067
[DANIEL GRUNTS]

9
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:27,533
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

10
00:00:27,533 --> 00:00:29,367
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

11
00:00:29,367 --> 00:00:32,533
(In Korean) Mom, I can't--

12
00:00:32,533 --> 00:00:36,000
That chambermaid is flirting
with my Daniel!

13
00:00:36,433 --> 00:00:39,133
I don't think he's being
honest with you

14
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:40,633
about this maid.

15
00:00:41,267 --> 00:00:43,167
Huh?

16
00:00:46,267 --> 00:00:47,700
[CHAIRMAN SONG] (In Korean)
<i> Just find the necklace.</i>

17
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,633
<i>It will lead you to my daughter.</i>

18
00:00:52,533 --> 00:00:58,533
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

19
00:00:58,533 --> 00:01:01,667
<i> Get her DNA to confirm...</i>

20
00:01:02,633 --> 00:01:04,133
<i> and I'll make you</i>

21
00:01:04,133 --> 00:01:07,233
<i>the youngest CEO of my company.</i>

22
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:10,600
<i> And Daniel...</i>

23
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:14,167
<i> No one must know.</i>

24
00:01:14,367 --> 00:01:20,700
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

25
00:01:23,467 --> 00:01:30,500
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

26
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:34,767
(In Korean) What a pain...

27
00:01:36,067 --> 00:01:39,267
We need to be smart
about this, my dear.

28
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:43,267
It's not just your man
who's at stake here.

29
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:46,733
Mom will take care of it.

30
00:01:46,733 --> 00:01:53,667
[DARK MUSIC PLAYING]
